{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652860/extras/06eafc198e0cc49dca97d623f10584f6.avif?t=1772114708\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652860/extras_big/06eafc198e0cc49dca97d623f10584f6.avif?t=1772114708 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Touhou Eternal Frontier&quot; \u2013 A 3D Touhou Action Indie Game Set in a Futuristic City</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start Screen Illustration: Niono Myon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touhou Eternal Frontier</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Touhou Eternal Frontier&quot; is not a Magic Survival or Vampire Survivors game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single-player 3D action game in which you control familiar Touhou Project characters,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >exploring various 3D maps and progressing through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will develop their characters,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlocking new elements through leveling up and achievements,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and exploring the worlds prepared for each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652860/extras/bb58f79ae18449d94d2d2acdfec442a2.avif?t=1772114708\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9 Featuring characters from the Touhou Project</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa Explore multiple 3D maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 The game unfolds as you progress through the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b06 Character growth through leveling up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Achievements for added replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Third-person 3D action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652860/extras/d794369f4a38e2695710c60651a2831c.avif?t=1772114708\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recommended for:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of Touhou Project characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to play a 3D action game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy exploration, growth, and achievement unlocking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to take your time with single-player gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a survivor-style game (focused on auto-attacks and a 20-minute time limit)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no multiplayer elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an indie game created by a private developer</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"LevelUP20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652860/946abc6376d606c819dff4a786ad766902731f49.jpg"},{"name":"LevelUP100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652860/e035b1bec27790c5c21efdf00c144e4041283ffd.jpg"},{"name":"LevelUP500","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652860/7e67ffe43fe9fcbaf3d9da853a4affeb57931093.jpg"},{"name":"LevelUP1000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652860/a2aa4caa9881984b89354283713aab05d169b7c4.jpg"},{"name":"LevelUP5000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652860/ec1bc990de0ca5797c3af7c32ed744287834f269.jpg"},{"name":"GameStart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652860/242c3a889da12062a22ca33b95c4b5a1128b9d7f.jpg"},{"name":"Teleporting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652860/84aa6fb9b416d4c1ff27dc93ec87b73cd5d4cfc